{"seq":2,"slug":"priors-in-practice","title":"实践中的先验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/bayesian-data-analysis/practice/priors-in-practice","wordCount":1760,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"实践中的先验\">实践中的先验</h1><p><a href=\"../foundations/priors-likelihood\">先验与似然</a>讲了先验的理论分类，但真到一个项目里，问题变得很具体：这个回归系数的先验该写 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Normal}(0, 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Normal</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 还是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Normal}(0, 100)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Normal</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>？我没有任何领域知识，是不是该用「无信息」先验？模型对我的先验有多敏感，会不会换个先验结论就翻盘？这一篇把先验从一个让人焦虑的主观选择，变成一套有章可循、可检验的建模决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>实践中的先验设定围绕三个动作展开：选一个合理量级的弱信息先验、用先验预测检查验证它隐含的数据是否合理、用先验敏感性分析确认结论不被先验任意左右。贯穿这三者的核心理念是：先验不必「正确」或「客观」，但必须「可辩护」——你能说清它为什么是那个量级，并能证明数据有机会推翻它。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[确定参数的合理量级] --&gt; B[选弱信息先验&lt;br/&gt;软约束到该量级]&#10;    B --&gt; C[先验预测检查&lt;br/&gt;模拟数据是否合理]&#10;    C --&gt;|荒谬| A&#10;    C --&gt;|合理| D[拟合模型]&#10;    D --&gt; E[先验敏感性分析&lt;br/&gt;换先验结论变吗]&#10;    E --&gt;|结论翻盘| F[数据不足以盖过先验&lt;br/&gt;需更多数据或更强证据]&#10;    E --&gt;|结论稳定| G[先验可辩护 可汇报]\">flowchart TD\n    A[确定参数的合理量级] --&gt; B[选弱信息先验&lt;br/&gt;软约束到该量级]\n    B --&gt; C[先验预测检查&lt;br/&gt;模拟数据是否合理]\n    C --&gt;|荒谬| A\n    C --&gt;|合理| D[拟合模型]\n    D --&gt; E[先验敏感性分析&lt;br/&gt;换先验结论变吗]\n    E --&gt;|结论翻盘| F[数据不足以盖过先验&lt;br/&gt;需更多数据或更强证据]\n    E --&gt;|结论稳定| G[先验可辩护 可汇报]</pre><p>下表给出常见参数的弱信息先验起点（假设预测变量已标准化），它们是实践中的可靠默认值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数类型</th>\n<th>推荐弱信息先验</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准化回归系数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Normal}(0, 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Normal</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Normal}(0, 2.5)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Normal</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>软约束到合理效应量级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>截距（已中心化数据）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>大</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Normal}(0, 大)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Normal</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">大</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 按响应尺度</td>\n<td>截距通常需更宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准差/尺度参数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{HalfNormal}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">HalfNormal</span></span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Exponential}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Exponential</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>保证为正、轻惩罚大值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层次模型组间标准差</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{HalfNormal}(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">HalfNormal</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 等</td>\n<td>避免漏斗、约束收缩程度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相关矩阵</td>\n<td>LKJ 先验</td>\n<td>专为相关结构设计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"无信息先验的幻觉\">无信息先验的幻觉</h2><p>新手最常见的冲动是「我不想引入偏见，所以用无信息先验」——通常是极宽的均匀分布或方差巨大的正态。这个直觉有两个问题。其一，真正的无信息往往不存在：对参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 均匀，不等于对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 均匀，「无知」会随参数化而改变，所谓客观只是错觉。其二，过宽的扁平先验不仅不安全，反而有害——它会给荒谬的参数值（比如效应大到物理上不可能）分配可观的先验概率，在小样本下污染后验，甚至让某些模型的后验不可积或采样困难。</p>\n<p>正因如此，现代贝叶斯实践的默认不是无信息先验，而是弱信息先验：不假装无知，而是注入一点「常识量级」的约束。比如对标准化后的回归系数用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Normal}(0, 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Normal</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，等于说「我不知道效应方向，但相信它不会大得离谱」——这几乎总是真的，且它稳定了计算、排除了荒谬值，却又宽到让任何像样的数据轻松主导后验。把扁平先验当默认是<a href=\"pitfalls\">陷阱与误用</a>里点名的典型错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用先验预测检查校准先验\">用先验预测检查校准先验</h2><p>怎么知道一个先验是不是「合理量级」？答案是别在参数尺度上凭空想，而是把先验隐含的数据画出来看。这就是<a href=\"workflow-diagnostics\">工作流与诊断</a>里介绍的先验预测检查在先验设定中的核心用法：从先验抽参数、模拟数据，看模拟数据是否落在物理/业务可能的范围内。</p>\n<p>一个经典例子：身高对体重的回归，若给斜率配 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Normal}(0, 10)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Normal</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的「宽」先验，先验预测会生成「身高增加一厘米、体重变化几百公斤」这种荒诞关系；把先验收紧到反映合理量级，模拟出的关系就回到常识范围。关键洞察是：先验的影响在原始参数尺度上常常看不出来（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Normal}(0,10)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Normal</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 看着挺无害），但一旦经过似然映射到数据尺度，荒谬立刻显形。所以先验校准应该在数据尺度上做，而不是盯着参数的数字猜。</p>\n<h2 id=\"先验敏感性分析\">先验敏感性分析</h2><p>设好了先验、模型也拟合了，还剩最后一个问题：结论有多依赖这个先验？先验敏感性分析回答它——用几个不同的合理先验（比如把尺度放大一倍、缩小一半，或换个分布族）重新拟合，看关键结论是否稳定。</p>\n<p>结果有两种走向，都有价值。若换先验后结论基本不变，说明数据足够强、主导了后验，你可以放心汇报，先验只是稳定剂。若换先验后结论明显改变，这不是失败而是重要发现：它意味着数据不足以盖过先验，你目前的结论本质上是由先验驱动的——此时诚实的做法是明说结论对先验敏感、报告不同先验下的结果范围，而不是挑一个顺眼的汇报。这种敏感性在小样本和<a href=\"../models/hierarchical-models\">层次模型</a>的组间方差参数上尤其常见，也正是<a href=\"../models/model-comparison\">模型比较</a>里贝叶斯因子那么危险的原因——它对先验的敏感度比基于预测的标准高得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把先验当协作而非负担\">把先验当协作而非负担</h2><p>很多人把「必须显式声明先验」视为贝叶斯方法的负担，但换个角度它是优势：先验逼你把建模假设摊到台面上，而不是像许多频率派方法那样把假设藏在默认设置里。一个写清楚的弱信息先验，配上先验预测检查的截图和敏感性分析的表格，构成的是一份透明、可复现、可被同行审查的建模决策记录。在领域专家在场时，先验还是把专家知识正式纳入模型的唯一通道——把「我们做了十年，效应一般在某范围」翻译成一个先验分布，比拍脑袋设默认值可辩护得多。先验设定的成熟标志，是你能对每个先验回答「为什么是这个量级、它隐含的数据合理吗、结论对它敏感吗」这三个问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>实践中先验设定围绕三步：选合理量级的弱信息先验、用先验预测检查校准、用敏感性分析确认稳健。</li>\n<li>无信息先验大多是幻觉：无知随参数化而变，过宽的扁平先验会污染后验、引发计算问题。</li>\n<li>默认应用弱信息先验（如标准化系数配 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Normal}(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Normal</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），注入常识量级约束又让数据轻松主导。</li>\n<li>先验是否合理应在数据尺度上判断：用先验预测检查把先验隐含的数据画出来，荒谬立刻显形。</li>\n<li>先验敏感性分析换几个合理先验重拟合：结论稳定则放心，结论翻盘则说明结论由先验驱动、须诚实报告。</li>\n<li>显式先验是优势而非负担：它让建模假设透明、可审查，并提供纳入专家知识的正式通道。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实践中的先验","id":"实践中的先验"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"无信息先验的幻觉","id":"无信息先验的幻觉"},{"level":2,"text":"用先验预测检查校准先验","id":"用先验预测检查校准先验"},{"level":2,"text":"先验敏感性分析","id":"先验敏感性分析"},{"level":2,"text":"把先验当协作而非负担","id":"把先验当协作而非负担"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"工作流与诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/bayesian-data-analysis/practice/workflow-diagnostics"},"next":{"title":"陷阱与误用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/bayesian-data-analysis/practice/pitfalls"}}